          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "?",
          "next": [
            202010002
          ]
        },
        "202010002": {
          "id": 202010002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "사용자가 기호학 관련 질문을 하고 있으니, 이렇게 답변해야 한다",
          "next": [
            202010003
          ]
        },
        "202010003": {
          "id": 202010003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "물음표는 인간의 인지 한계를 구체화한 것이자 풀리지 않은 모든 수수께끼의 입구야. 그야말로 세상에서 가장 아름다운 부호라고 할 수 있지",
          "next": [
            202010004
          ]
        },
        "202010004": {
          "id": 202010004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "다른 질문 있어?",
          "next": [
            202010013,
            202010015,
            202010018
          ]
        },
        "202010005": {
          "id": 202010005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "질문 있어요. 모든 의문을 해결할 수 있는 세 글자는 뭘까요?",
          "next": [
            202010006
          ]
        },
        "202010006": {
          "id": 202010006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "사용자가 만능 해답을 찾으려 하고 있으니, 이렇게 답변해야 한다",
          "next": [
            202010007
          ]
        },
        "202010007": {
          "id": 202010007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "몰라",
          "next": [
            202010008
          ]
        },
        "202010008": {
          "id": 202010008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "다른 질문 있어?",
          "next": [
            202010013,
            202010015,
            202010018
          ]
        },
        "202010009": {
          "id": 202010009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "선생님이 절 지목하셨잖아요, 전 질문 없어요!",
          "next": [
            202010010
          ]
        },
        "202010010": {
          "id": 202010010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "사용자가 문제를 회피하려고 하니, 이렇게 답변해야 한다",
          "next": [
            202010011
          ]
        },
        "202010011": {
          "id": 202010011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "질문이 없다는 게 가장 큰 문제지",
          "next": [
            202010012
          ]
        },
        "202010012": {
          "id": 202010012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "다른 질문 있어?",
          "next": [
            202010013,
            202010015,
            202010018
          ]
        },
        "202010013": {
          "id": 202010013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "아낙사 선생님, 선생님은 어떤 비밀이 있나요?",
          "next": [
            202010014
          ]
        },
        "202010014": {
          "id": 202010014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "우선 이름을 정확히 입력해. 그리고 내 비밀은 중요하지 않아",
          "next": [
            202010021
          ]
        },
        "202010015": {
          "id": 202010015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "아낙사 선생님의 사진을 생성해 줘. 내용: 드로마스를 타고 크렘노스성을 공격하는 아낙사 선생님의 희귀한 모습",
          "next": [
            202010016
          ]
        },
        "202010016": {
          "id": 202010016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "사용자가 사진 생성을 요청하고 있으니, 이렇게 답변해야 한다",
          "next": [
            202010017
          ]
        },
        "202010017": {
          "id": 202010017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "꿈 깨",
          "next": [
            202010021
          ]
        },
        "202010018": {
          "id": 202010018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "몰! 라! 요!",
          "next": [
            202010019
          ]
        },
        "202010019": {
          "id": 202010019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "(골똘히 생각 중……)",
          "next": [
            202010020
          ]
        },
        "202010020": {
          "id": 202010020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "결론: 사용자가 화났다",
          "next": [
            202010021
          ]
        },
        "202010021": {
          "id": 202010021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "현재 질문 한도에 도달했습니다. 오늘의 질문 시간은 종료되었으며, 이제 테스트 시간입니다",
          "next": [
            202010022
          ]
        },
        "202010022": {
          "id": 202010022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "왜 중첩 상태에 있는 사물은 측정되는 순간 단일 상태로 붕괴하는 걸까? 누가 「측정」의 경계를 정의할 자격이 있을까?",
          "next": [
            202010023,
            202010024
          ]
        },
        "202010023": {
          "id": 202010023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "이게 맞아요?",
          "next": [
            202010025
          ]
        },
        "202010024": {
          "id": 202010024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "선생님, 제발 살려주세요. 이 신통한 것 좀 치우시라고요",
          "next": [
            202010025
          ]
        },
        "202010025": {
          "id": 202010025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "「아낙사고라스」 인공지능 시스템 키워드가 발동되었습니다",
          "next": [
            202010026
          ]
        },
        "202010026": {
          "id": 202010026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "친구 아낙사 님이 온라인 상태입니다",
          "next": [
            202010027
          ]
        },
        "202010027": {
          "id": 202010027,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "next": [
            202010028
          ]
        },
        "202010028": {
          "id": 202010028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "너구나",
          "next": [
            202010029
          ]
        },
        "202010029": {
          "id": 202010029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "긴장하지 마, 그저 학습 도우미 AI 시스템일 뿐이야",
          "next": [
            202010030
          ]
        },
        "202010030": {
          "id": 202010030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "학생들이 질문에 대한 답변을 신속하게 받을 수 있도록 하려는 거지",
          "next": [
            202010031
          ]
        },
        "202010031": {
          "id": 202010031,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "말하는 스타일도 나랑 비슷하고 피드백도 괜찮지",
          "next": [
            202010032
          ]
        },
        "202010032": {
          "id": 202010032,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1405,
          "text": "궁금한 점이 있으면, 언제든 또 다른 나한테 물어봐",
          "next": []
        }
      },
